; A directive registered via --external-directive in "block" mode currently
; behaves the same as "line": only the header line is skipped, and the
; surrounding transactions parse normally.  Skipping an indented body will be
; added in a future PR.
newdirective experiment tag=cool region=us

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Checking    $100.00
    Equity:Opening

test --external-directive newdirective:block reg
24-Jan-01 Opening               Assets:Checking             $100.00      $100.00
                                Equity:Opening             $-100.00            0
end test
